<SiteLayout title="Cancellation and refund policy"><article class="policy-page"><span class="eyebrow">INFORMATION</span><h1>Plans can<br /><em>change.</em></h1><p class="setup-hint">No cancellation cutoff or refund promise has been invented. Owner approval is required before accepting bookings.</p><h2>Before booking</h2><p>Ocean Valley’s cancellation, rescheduling, missed-appointment and refund terms will be displayed here and during booking once confirmed by the owner.</p><h2>Payment reversals</h2><p>A refund must not be described as complete until the payment provider confirms its status. Provider processing times and eligibility must be supplied by Ocean Valley.</p></article></SiteLayout>
